# AWS Prescriptive Guidance AWS Key Management Service best practices

> Learn best practices for AWS Key Management Service, including key management, data protection, access control, monitoring, and cost optimization.

- [Introduction](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/prescriptive-guidance/latest/aws-kms-best-practices/introduction.md)
- [About AWS KMS keys](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/prescriptive-guidance/latest/aws-kms-best-practices/about-kms-keys.md)
- [Managing keys](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/prescriptive-guidance/latest/aws-kms-best-practices/key-management.md)
- [Identity and access management](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/prescriptive-guidance/latest/aws-kms-best-practices/access.md)
- [Detection and monitoring](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/prescriptive-guidance/latest/aws-kms-best-practices/monitoring.md)
- [Cost and billing](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/prescriptive-guidance/latest/aws-kms-best-practices/cost.md)
- [Resources](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/prescriptive-guidance/latest/aws-kms-best-practices/resources.md)
- [Contributors](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/prescriptive-guidance/latest/aws-kms-best-practices/contributors.md)
- [Document history](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/prescriptive-guidance/latest/aws-kms-best-practices/doc-history.md)

## [Data protection](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/prescriptive-guidance/latest/aws-kms-best-practices/data-protection.md)

- [Encryption](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/prescriptive-guidance/latest/aws-kms-best-practices/data-protection-encryption.md): Learn best practices for encrypting data by using AWS Key Management Service, including log encryption, database encryption, and PCI DSS compliance.
- [Key rotation](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/prescriptive-guidance/latest/aws-kms-best-practices/data-protection-key-rotation.md): Learn about key rotation strategies for AWS Key Management Service, including best practices for specific AWS resource types.
- [Using the AWS Encryption SDK](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/prescriptive-guidance/latest/aws-kms-best-practices/data-protection-sdk.md): Learn how to implement client-side encryption using the AWS Encryption SDK, explore best practices, and determine if it's the right tool for your security needs.


